  'moletsi-mall-opens-moletji-rural-shoppers-2026-11-14',
  'Moletsi Mall opens, bringing formal retail closer to Moletji villages',
  'Business', '2026-11-14', 'Review Online', 'https://www.citizen.co.za/review-online/news-headlines/local-news/2026/11/14/moletsi-mall-opens-new-opportunities-for-rural-community/',
  'The new Moletsi Mall near Moletji has been officially opened, giving residents of surrounding villages a local shopping centre with more phases still to come.',
  'Moletsi Mall, a new shopping centre serving the Moletji area north-west of Polokwane, has been officially opened. The Limpopo Premier attended the launch, and the Capricorn District Municipality has said the opening was also attended by its Executive Mayor.

The first phase covers roughly 10,000 square metres of retail space. According to a property-industry report published before the launch, a second phase will lift the total beyond 14,000 square metres. The Shoprite group anchors the centre. Pharmacy, banking, clothing and fast-food brands were also named as opening-day tenants, among them KFC and Capitec. Review Online reports that the Premier said the event drew people from more than 179 villages, and that phases two and three are planned.

The Capricorn District Municipality says the mall brings modern retail closer to Moletji and nearby villages, so residents travel less far to shop. The municipality expects it to stimulate economic activity, create jobs and give local entrepreneurs a way into the retail economy.

Review Online reports that the Moletsi Taxi Association welcomed the centre and says it does not expect lost income, even though fewer passengers may travel to Seshego Circle Centre or the city centre. Some residents quoted by the paper hope more locally owned businesses, such as restaurants and cellphone shops, will find space there. Shoppers should check with individual stores for trading hours.',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  '["https://www.citizen.co.za/review-online/news-headlines/local-news/2026/11/14/moletsi-mall-opens-new-opportunities-for-rural-community/", "https://www.cdm.org.za/executive-mayor-joins-limpopo-premier-at-official-opening-of-moletsi-mall/", "https://www.commercial-property.co.za/6021_news_Exemplar-to-open-Leratong-City-and-Moletsi-Mall-on-consecutive-days-at-the-end-of-October.html"]',
  'agent'
);
